Files are copied unmodified. plugins/replayers/kplayer/CMakeLists.txt assembles kpl14.s with
vasmm68k_mot -m68000 -no-opt -Fbin, the same flags HippoPlayer's Makefile uses; the result was checked
byte-identical (6080 bytes) to HippoPlayer's own `kpl` build.
